      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This talk will highlight the fundamentals and principles behind JVM-level clustering with Terracotta. A short code example will be evolved over several steps to provide a feel of Terracotta is used in practice.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </abstract>
